      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5509ac18528664da",
      "translationZh": "已发布的资源",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6877f0a8dc37d048",
      "translationZh": "使用 Hugging Face Hub 上的 SD XL 模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "660f5d1d7c8ad6f8",
      "translationZh": "作为此次发布的一部分，我们发布了两个不同的 Core ML 版本的 Stable Diffusion XL。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "11d96a0e08c9b8eb",
      "translationZh": "apple/coreml-stable-diffusion-xl-base 是一个完整的流水线，未进行任何量化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0cb9776a1ea1cd9e",
      "translationZh": "apple/coreml-stable-diffusion-mixed-bit-palettization 包含一个完整的流水线（以及其他产物），其中的 UNet 已替换为采用混合位宽调色板量化方案的版本，实现了相当于每个参数 4.5 比特的压缩效果。体积从 4.8 GB 降至 1.4 GB，减少了 71%，而且我们认为质量依然很出色。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c8ad7eb2f263c804",
      "translationZh": "这两个模型都可以使用 Apple 的 Swift 命令行推理应用或 Hugging Face 的演示应用进行测试。以下是后者使用新的 Stable Diffusion XL 流水线的示例：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0afcc27a208fc843",
      "translationZh": "与此前发布的 Stable Diffusion 版本一样，我们期待社区针对不同领域推出新颖的微调版本，其中许多版本将被转换为 Core ML 格式。你可以关注 Hub 中的这个筛选条件，探索这些版本！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "71d290b0709fab87",
      "translationZh": "Stable Diffusion XL 可在运行 macOS 14 公开测试版的 Apple Silicon Mac 上使用。它目前使用 ORIGINAL 注意力实现，该实现面向 CPU + GPU 计算单元。请注意，refiner 阶段尚未移植。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e12e7142bdaf2684",
      "translationZh": "以下是我们在不同设备上测得的性能数据，供参考：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6ba0bdeccb426d7b",
      "translationZh": "设备",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c68628b2a442e02e",
      "translationZh": "端到端延迟（s）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce2eaf1e462ce8b4",
      "translationZh": "扩散速度（iter/s）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "962f85a27854336f",
